 *   1. GAME MODE  — how you play (survival/hardcore/creative/peaceful).
 *      Compact, iconographic, light-touch. Keeps your world.
 *   2. GAME TYPE  — what you play (vanilla/skyblock/prison/…).
 *      Large cinematic art cards. The page's visual centre. Swaps your world
